;; DECOMP BEGINS

;; og:preserve-this bring-up stub: fmv-player-run-texture is a declaration-
;; side extern with no defun anywhere (the extern-no-defun class, issue 551).
;; The live call site is scene.gc:1195, inside (enter wait scene-player)'s
;; (when (-> self scene ipu) ...) branch; 12 landed tsk-scenes in
;; task-scenes.gc carry a non-#f :ipu, so any of them reaching that line
;; jumped straight to address 0 and killed gk. This is NOT retail's body:
;; retail's fmv-player.o defines roughly 20 functions and none of them are
;; landed here. Returning #f disarms the landmine without claiming FMV
;; playback works; retires when the real FMV landing (issue 569) lands the
;; actual body.
(defun fmv-player-run-texture ((arg0 int) (arg1 process-tree))
  #f
  )
